cff-version: 1.2.0
title: MAMUT-routing-Sintef2008
type: dataset
message: >-
  Cite this metadata for the MAMUT-routing curation of the Sintef2008 VRPTW benchmark. Also cite the original benchmark: Solomon (1987) and Gehring and Homberger (1999) for the instances, and the SINTEF VRPTW benchmark for the hierarchical objective convention. Record the exact Git commit used.
