url: "https://github.com/ANR-MAMUT/MAMUT-routing-Sintef2008"
abstract: >-
  This repository provides the MAMUT-routing curation of the classical Solomon and Gehring-Homberger VRPTW instances under the SINTEF 2008 hierarchical objective convention, with curated best-known solutions. The underlying benchmark definitions and some best-known solution sources originate from third-party historical benchmark material, and the source attributions are documented in README.md and LICENSE.
